{"4894140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Muhit", "steam_appid": 4894140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5106360, 5125690], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Muhit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city divided by opportunity, crime, and desperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muhit is a story-driven adventure set in an alternative version of 1990s Istanbul. You play as a young man searching for answers about his missing family while trying to survive in a city where every connection matters and every decision carries consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894140/extras/4d938a47b9e3ff045cfeab9ef2bda2ff.avif?t=1787489645\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the city, meet people from all walks of life, take on odd jobs, and slowly build a place for yourself in Istanbul's growing underground world. What begins as a simple search for the truth gradually pulls you into a network of criminals, smugglers, corrupt officials, and dangerous opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894140/extras/66bd28e1d56255c3749da10fd3ccdf40.avif?t=1787489645\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore districts inspired by 90s Istanbul, uncover hidden stories, earn money through legal and illegal work, and decide how far you're willing to go to find the people you're looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894140/extras/0772ea5ff6d75b866ff99d0ea6fffd33.avif?t=1787489645\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven single-player experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an alternative version of 1990s Istanbul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery surrounding your missing family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with unique characters and factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs, earn money, and gain influence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a world of crime, corruption, and opportunity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments inspired by Turkish urban life of the 1990s.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey starts with a question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answers may change who you become.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Muhit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city divided by opportunity, crime, and desperation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muhit is a story-driven adventure set in an alternative version of 1990s Istanbul. You play as a young man searching for answers about his missing family while trying to survive in a city where every connection matters and every decision carries consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894140/extras/4d938a47b9e3ff045cfeab9ef2bda2ff.avif?t=1787489645\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the city, meet people from all walks of life, take on odd jobs, and slowly build a place for yourself in Istanbul's growing underground world. What begins as a simple search for the truth gradually pulls you into a network of criminals, smugglers, corrupt officials, and dangerous opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894140/extras/66bd28e1d56255c3749da10fd3ccdf40.avif?t=1787489645\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore districts inspired by 90s Istanbul, uncover hidden stories, earn money through legal and illegal work, and decide how far you're willing to go to find the people you're looking for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894140/extras/0772ea5ff6d75b866ff99d0ea6fffd33.avif?t=1787489645\" width=1080 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-driven single-player experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an alternative version of 1990s Istanbul.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mystery surrounding your missing family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with unique characters and factions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on jobs, earn money, and gain influence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a world of crime, corruption, and opportunity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments inspired by Turkish urban life of the 1990s.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey starts with a question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answers may change who you become.</p>", "short_description": "Muhit is a story-driven adventure set in an alternative 1990s Istanbul. Search for your missing family, explore the city, meet dangerous people, and slowly climb your way into the criminal underworld. Every job, connection, and decision brings you closer to the truth.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4894140/eefb0a4dc30a21fe79b2e55e53a3e91fec7ae9b2/header.jpg?t=1787489645", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.st